  "intro": {
    "title": "Im Mai",
    "paragraphs": [
      "German months look almost like the English ones, and all are masculine. 'In May' is im Mai: im = in dem.",
      "Two small traps: Juni and Juli sound alike, so on the phone people say Juno and Julei. And August is stressed at the end."
    ]
  },
